	(descr "Bourns SM91502AL BMS transformer, one channel with common mode choke, 1000 VDC working. Land pattern per Bourns datasheet rev. 07/25 Recommended Layout: pads 0.76 x 1.27 mm, 2.54 mm pitch, rows 7.11 mm inner / 9.65 mm outer; body 7.62 x 6.7 mm, 5.72 mm max tall. Drawn turned 90 deg CW from the datasheet top view (pin 1 dot bottom left there) so pins 1-2-3 run down the left column as on Pulse_HM2113ZNL. Pads CCW from pin 1.")
